  "description": "Given an integer array nums, return the number of longest increasing subsequences.",
  "target": null,
  "pseudocode": "1. n = nums.length\n2. lengths = Array(n).fill(1)\n3. counts = Array(n).fill(1)\n4. for i from 0 to n-1:\n5.   for j from 0 to i-1:\n6.     if nums[j] < nums[i]:\n7.       if lengths[j] + 1 > lengths[i]:\n8.         lengths[i] = lengths[j] + 1\n9.         counts[i] = counts[j]\n10.      else if lengths[j] + 1 == lengths[i]:\n11.        counts[i] += counts[j]",
  "steps": [
